Package: CSSpatialNet
Title: Cell-type specific spatial autocorrelation and covariance estimation 
    from spot-level spatial data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Max", "Woollard", 
        email = "mwoo5086@uni.sydney.edu.au", 
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment=c(ORCID="0009-0000-6319-6926"))
Description: CSSpatialNet is a method for estimating cell-type-specific spatial
    autocorrelations and gene-gene covariances from spot-level spatial data.
    This package uncludes all functions to estimate the parameters of the model,
    as well as compute confidence intervals for the parameters.
